#: fsview_part.cpp:199
msgid ""
"FSView intentionally does not support automatic updates when changes are made to files or directories, currently visible in FSView, from the outside.\n"
"For details, see the 'Help/FSView Manual'."
msgstr ""
"FSView memang tidak menyokong kemas kini automatik apabila perubahan dibuat kepada fail atau direktori, kini dapat dilihat dalam FSView, dari luar.\n"
"Untuk rincian, lihat 'Manual Bantuan/FSView'."

